ckground\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050602205357&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Axe_33d4f5.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a fire axe <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Atk:27 physical +11 fire, Def:16 +1)</span>.<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 35 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 40.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">The blade is a magic flame.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It emits a very small amount of light (makes your screen a little bit brighter). It is enchanted with eternal fire, so it does also fire damage beside the normal damage. The Summer Update 2008 changed the attack description to: 27 physical + 11 fire.\n<br/>\n</p><p>Can be obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/fire-axe-quest\">Fire Axe Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>